{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">LIBRETTO EXPLICATIVE</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">DEL</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Tabellas Auxiliar Delmas</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">PRIME SERIE</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">TABELLA N<sup>o</sup> 1</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">Le schola, le lyceo, le classe.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Description general.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — Iste tabella representa un <b>classe</b> in un <b>lyceo</b>. In iste classe il ha octo <b>tabulas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"tabli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> e octo <b>bancos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"benki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>. Sur cata banco sede tres alumnos. Le <b>professor</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> sede sur un <b>sedia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"stulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> in su <b>cathedra</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"katedro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button>.","t01-02-1":"2. — Al sinistra del cathedra se trova un <b>armario</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> <b>vitrate</b>. Al dextra es le <b>tabula nigre</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"nigra tabelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> con le <b>spongia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"vishilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> e le <b>creta</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"kreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"Super le cathedra pende <b>tabellas mural</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> e un <b>carta</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"mapo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>.","t01-03-1":"3. — Non tote le alumnos es a lor <b>loco</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"plaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>. Johannes <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> sta al tabula, ille tene le spongia e dele le <b>figuras geometric</b>.","t01-03-2":"Petro es presso le cathedra, ille collige le <b>devores scripte</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"skribo-taski\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button>, e los porta al professor.","t01-04-1":"4. — Iste professor es le professor del <b>linguas vive</b>. Ille insenia al alumnos parlar, leger e scriber linguas estranier <b>(le germano, le anglese, le espaniol, le italiano, le russo</b> o <b>le francese)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — Le classe es multo vaste e multo clar. In le fundo il ha un large <b>fenestra</b> con duo <b>fenestrettas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"postigi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> e le <b>porta vitrate</b> pro aerar e illuminar lo.","t01-05-2":"Iste classe non es frigide. In le medio il ha, pro calefacer lo, un multo bon <b>stufa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"furnelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> con su <b>tubo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"tubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"Al pariete es fixate <b>crocos pro vestimentos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"vest-hoki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button>, de illos pende le cappellos e le mantellos del scholares.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Le corte de recreation</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — Le <b>horologio</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"horlojo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> indica novem horas e cinque minutas.","t01-06-2":"Le <b>recreation</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"amuz-tempo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> justo finiva e le lection recomencia. Le loco de recreation se trova in le <b>corte</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"korto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>. Nos vide alcun alumnos qui juga. Un <b>sub-maestro</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"Submaestro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> los survelia.","t01-07-1":"7. — In le corte nos vide ancora diverse personas, nominatemente le <b>inspector</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspektisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, le director del schola <b>(director del lyceo)</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"(liceestro)\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> e le <b>censor</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"censoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"Le inspector inspecta le scholas, le director del lyceo dirige le lyceo, le censor survelia le studios.","t01-07-3":"Le quarte persona es le <b>portero</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"pordisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. Ille porta sub le bracio un registro pro inscriber le absentes.","t01-08-1":"8. — In le fundo del corte il ha le <b>apparatos gymnastic</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"gimnastikal aparati\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> e le officina pro le <b>labores manual</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>.","t01-08-2":"Al dextra del tabella nos comencia a vider le <b>classes</b> de <b>musica</b> e de <b>designo</b>.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Description detaliate.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Le bon alumnos.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — Le alumnos del prime banco al dextra del cathedra es <b>Henrico</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"ia-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>Stephano</b> e <b>Carolo</b>.","t01-09-2":"Henrico es multo attentive e laboriose, ille ascolta le professor. Sur su tabula ille ha un <b>quaderno</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, un <b>libro</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"libro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, un <b>lexico</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"lexiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> e un <b>portaplumas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"skribiluyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>. Su libro ha multe <b>paginas</b>, cata capitulo contine plure <b>paragraphos</b> e cata <b>linea</b> multe <b>parolas</b>.","t01-09-4":"Su vicino Stephano <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> es fervorose. Ille nota sur su quaderno le lection pro le vice sequente. Ille ha un belle <b>scriptura</b>. Su libro es claudite. Nos vide solmente le <b>copertura</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"kovrilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>. Presso ille se trova su <b>compasso</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"kompaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>.","t01-09-5":"Carolo <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> tene con le mano su libro, ille lo aperi pro releger su lection. Ille ha, como cata alumno, un <b>incastro</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"inkuyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button> ante se. Ille es obediente.","t01-10-1":"10. — Al tabula vicin es <b>Ludovico, Antonio</b> e <b>Paulo</b>. Ludovico recita su <b>lection</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"leciono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> e responde al <b>questiones</b> del professor. Antonio <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> es multo inattentive, mesmo alcun vices le professor le puni. Paulo <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> es un bon camerada, affabile e complacente. Ille es multo attentive.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Le mal alumnos.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — Detra Henrico se trova <b>Georgio</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Georgius\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>. Ille non es un mal puero, ma ille es <b>garrule</b>, inattentive e petulante. Su <b>frivolitate</b> e <b>disobedientia</b> causa <b>disordine</b> durante le lection e sovente ille merita un sever <b>advertimento</b>. Su <b>quaderno de brossa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"klado-kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> es immunde, ille lo <b>macula de incausto</b> con su <b>penna</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"plumo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>, pro isto ille usa sempre su <b>gumma pro deler</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"efacokauchuko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>; su <b>portaquadernos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"kayeruyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> es lacerate, proque ille es multo negligente. Proque porta ille su <b>portacrayon</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"krayoniero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> in le classe del linguas vive?","t01-11-2":"Su vicino Edmundo <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> non le ama. Ille es in ver un pauco indolente, ma ille es taciturne e tranquille. Ille non garrula; ma, in loco de ascoltar, ille prefere leger le <b>narrationes</b> de su <b>libro de lectura</b>.","t01-11-3":"Le tertie alumno de iste banco es <b>Ludovico</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Ludovikus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. Ille es diligente. Ille scribe sur un blanc <b>folio de papiro</b>. Ante se, ille poneva su <b>papiro absorbente</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"absorbiva papero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>.","t01-12-1":"12. — Le alumnos del secunde banco, al sinistra del professor, es multo juvene. Le prime, le parve <b>Emilio</b>, non sape ancora multo ben scriber, ille porta su <b>ardesia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"ardezo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, su <b>stilo de ardesia</b> e su <b>spongia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"sponjo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button>.","t01-12-2":"Presso ille es <b>Augusto</b> e <b>Bernardo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernardus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>. Iste ultime labora ben, ma su <b>vestimento</b> es multo negligite.","t01-13-1":"13. — Detra illes se trova tres <b>indolentes</b>. <b>Alberto</b> non apprende su lectiones. <b>Jacobo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Iakobus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> dormi in loco de ascoltar. Su <b>indolentia</b> le vale <b>reproches</b> e mesmo <b>punitiones</b>. Finalmente <b>Christiano</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Kristianus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> es troppo frivole. Ille <b>se comporta</b> mal e non se effortia in nulle modo pro emendar se.","t01-14-1":"14. — Su vicinos, al contrario, es de bon conducta. <b>Ernesto</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernestus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> ama le ordine e le regularitate, ille usa sempre su <b>regula</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"linealo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> e su <b>crayon</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"krayono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>. Ille es <b>externo</b>.","t01-14-2":"<b>Francisco</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Franciskus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> es <b>interno</b>, ille es vestite de un uniforme, mangia e dormi in le lyceo. Ille es un bon <b>camerada</b>.","t01-14-3":"Mauricio talia su <b>crayon</b> con su <b>cultelletto</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"kulteleto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button>, ille es multo curose.","t01-14-4":"Ille porta tote su libros, su <b>grammatica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"gramatiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, su <b>carnet</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"notlibreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button>, e mesmo un <b>cossino pro scriber</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"skribkuseno\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. Su <b>sacco de schola</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"skolsako\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> es sur le solo detra ille.","t01-14-5":"Le duo tabulas in le fundo del classe es occupate per <b>bon alumnos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"bona lernanti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Designo e musica.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — In le <b>sala de designo</b> il ha gratiose <b>modellos</b> appendite al muro e un <b>lampa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lampo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> con <b>umbrella</b>, suspendite al plafon. Le <b>professor</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> es multo patiente, ille corrige le <b>designos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"desegnuri\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> del alumnos e les insenia designar un <b>busto</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"busto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> secundo le natura.","t01-16-1":"16. — Le <b>sala de musica</b> pare multo interessante. In illo on apprende leger le <b>musica</b>, solfear le <b>notas del gamma</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"gamnoti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> scribite sur le <b>pentagramma</b> (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.), cognoscer le <b>claves</b> e cantar gratiose <b>melodias</b>. On pone le partituras sur le <b>pupitro</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"pupitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button>. Un del alumnos <b>sona le piano</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"pianopleas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button> e le <b>professor de musica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"muzik-docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>batte le mesura</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"skandas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — Nos comencia a vider un angulo del <b>officina</b> pro <b>labores manual</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>, ubi le pueros pote apprender planar le ligno e limar le ferro. Isto non existe in tote le lyceos.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Le sala de scientias.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — Le professor de mathematica insenia al alumnos le <b>geometria, le arithmetica, le calculo</b> e le <b>systema metric</b>. Nos vide sur le tabella le principal figuras del geometria : <b>circulo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"rondo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>quadrato</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"quadrato\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, <b>triangulo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"triangulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, <b>linea</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"lineo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"Nos vide anque un <b>calculo</b>; illo non es ni un <b>addition</b>, ni un <b>subtraction</b>, ni un <b>multiplication</b> : illo es un <b>division</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"divido\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>.","t01-19-1":"19. — Sur le tabella del systema metric nos vide : un <b>metro</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"metro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, un <b>balancia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"balanco\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> e su <b>pesos</b>, un <b>litro</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"ponderili, litro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, un <b>decalitro</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"dekalitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, un <b>decilitro</b> e un <b>metro cubic</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"metral kubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"Le alumnos studia anque le <b>scientias natural</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button> — le zoologia <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zoologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, le botanica <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botaniko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, le geologia <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> — e le <b>historia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"In le armario il ha le apparatos de <b>physica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> e de <b>chimia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"kemio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button>.","t01-19-4":"Super le armario il ha : un <b>sphera</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"sfero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, un <b>cono</b> e un <b>globo terrestre</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"terglobo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"Super le tabellas pende un <b>carta</b> que monstra le cinque partes del mundo : <b>Europa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Europa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>Asia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Azia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, <b>Africa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Afrika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>America</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> e <b>Oceania</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Oceania\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, e le duo grande oceanos, le <b>Pacific</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Pacifiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> e le <b>Atlantic</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlantiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) Pro le <i>nomines de baptismo</i> on consilia anque transscriber los secundo le forma latin. Isto es le unic medio pro escappar a divergentias innumerabile. Del resto como eliger inter <i>Giovanni, Jean,</i> <i>Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan,</i> etc.? Va nos crear un dictionario special pro le nomines de baptismo? Prendamos del latino lor nominativo e dicamos : <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Gram. Complete)."}}
